      "content": "i know the numbers, i know the help lines, but i dont think they get it. it’s not just being sad. it’s like the world has already made a decision about me. i’m a social pariah. once people decide you’re the bad guy or just... nothing, there’s no coming back from that. there is no \"feeling better\" from being someone everyone has collectively decided is dead to them. do you even get that? how can i go back to a world where i don't belong anymore? it feels feels so keep me from trying rejoin a life that isn",
